# Third-party notices

BlinkCode AI has **no runtime dependencies** — the app is plain ES modules and
the browser platform. The following are used at build / development time, or are
bundled data.

## Model bundle (`src/models/ucg-v1.bin`)

- Produced by `tools/build-model.js` from a corpus of public-domain / open-source
  text (Python standard library docs, `/usr/share/doc`, the project's own source)
  plus generated binary and random data.
- Contains no third-party code; it is derived statistics (order-1 byte counts and
  DCT quantiser scales) generated by this project.

